"text": "\u2022 Concurrent `Promise.all` reads\n\u2022 In-Memory LRU Cache (30s TTL)\n\u2022 Timeouts (1.2s) & 2 attempts\n\u2022 Zod Schema & User Validation\n\u2022 Graceful partial degradation",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2022 Concurrent `Promise.all` reads\n\u2022 In-Memory LRU Cache (60s TTL)\n\u2022 Timeouts (1.5s) & Retries (up to 3x)\n\u2022 Zod Schema & User Validation\n\u2022 Graceful partial degradation",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
