      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2022 User Profile (`/users/:userId`)\n\u2022 Kundli Chart (`/kundli/:userId`)\n\u2022 Horoscope Transits (`/horoscope/:userId`)\n\u2022 Panchang Calendar (`/panchang`)\n(Typed in-code fixtures or external URLs)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
